Subject: [PATCH] ssrust (luci-app-shadowsocks-rust): drop unresolvable
 +shadowsocks-rust-config dependency

luci-app-ssrust (package name luci-app-shadowsocks-rust, upstream
muink/luci-app-ssrust) declares LUCI_DEPENDS:=+luci-base
+shadowsocks-rust-config, but no feed provides that package: every
shadowsocks-rust package only ships the sslocal/ssmanager/ssserver/
ssurl/ssservice subpackages. make package/install then fails with:

  pkg_hash_check_unresolved: cannot find dependency
  shadowsocks-rust-config for luci-app-shadowsocks-rust
  opkg_install_cmd: Cannot install package luci-app-shadowsocks-rust.
  Error 255

That dependency is an artifact of upstream's single-file ipk packaging
(.github/build-ipk.sh); the app itself already ships its init.d, default
UCI config and ssrules scripts. Its real runtime binaries are
/usr/bin/sslocal and /usr/bin/ssserver (init.d maps ss_local/ss_server
to those binary names), so replace the dependency with the matching
shadowsocks-rust subpackages instead.

Applied to feeds/kenzok8 (jell).

--- a/feeds/kenzok8/luci-app-ssrust/Makefile
+++ b/feeds/kenzok8/luci-app-ssrust/Makefile
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@ include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 PKG_NAME:=luci-app-shadowsocks-rust
 LUCI_NAME:=luci-app-shadowsocks-rust
 LUCI_TITLE:=LuCI Support for shadowsocks-rust
-LUCI_DEPENDS:=+luci-base +shadowsocks-rust-config
+LUCI_DEPENDS:=+luci-base +shadowsocks-rust-sslocal +shadowsocks-rust-ssserver

 PKG_MAINTAINER:=Anya Lin <hukk1996@gmail.com>
 PKG_LICENSE:=Apache-2.0
